This folder is a placeholder for installer prerequisites, which have to be put here before creating the installers.
The .exe files are not committed (see .gitignore). Check each file's version (Properties / Details) after download.

File naming
-----------
The installer scripts search for the redistributables under these names:

  VC_redist.x86.exe / .x64.exe / .arm64.exe        latest v14 (rolling), modern build only (Win10+)
  VC_redist_14.44.35211.0.x86.exe / .x64.exe       Win7 build (v143, VS2022 17.14 toolset)
  VC_redist_14.27.29114.0.x86.exe / .x64.exe       XP build (v141_xp toolset)

The latest one keeps the generic name, because the permalink moves forward. The OS-limited ones carry
their file version in the name: rename the downloaded VC_redist.<arch>.exe accordingly.

